// Tool pages
tools.boomerang.text=A thrown weapon that comes back on its own.\nCharge and release to throw. The Clasp decides its flight plan: glass seeks enemies, chorus pierces, shulker shells gather drops, redstone works blocks, blue slime deflects arrows.
tools.throwing_knife.text=A light blade made to be thrown.\nA short charge throws one; sneaking throws three. The Grip decides what they do: slime bounces blades for pickup, prismarine groups enemies, quartz stacks damage.
tools.heat_ray_gun.text=Burns solid fuel into a focused ray of heat.\nRight-click to fire; sneak + right-click refuels it. The Fuel Tank sets capacity, the Emitter charge speed and damage. Run it too hot and it needs a break.
tools.chain_blade.text=A chain on a handle that ricochets between enemies and drags them in.\nA charged throw sweeps the area; sneak + right-click empowers it. The Chain Link sets bounces, spare ammo and combo speed.
tools.pistol_sword.text=Two weapons in one. Slash in melee to gather bullets; right-click fires the loaded one.\nThe Gun Barrel sets ammo and ranged damage. For melee, trust the Sword Blade.

// Modifier pages
modifiers.capacity_heatraygun.text=Every tool runs out of something: fuel, ammo, charge. Each level gives that something a little more room.
modifiers.capacity_heatraygun.effects=Heat Ray Gun: +2000 fuel, +1 heat\nPistol Sword: +1 ammo\nChain Blade: +10 charge\nBoomerang: +1 active boomerang
modifiers.efficiency_heatraygun.text=Less waste each level. The same fuel goes further, the same charge does more, and thrown blades come back more often.
modifiers.efficiency_heatraygun.effects=Heat Ray Gun: +45% fuel efficiency\nChain Blade: -2 charge for a sweep\nBoomerang: +25% chance to refund ammo
modifiers.power_heatraygun.text=Heat aimed at damage instead of speed. Each level hits a little harder.
modifiers.power_heatraygun.effects=Heat Ray Gun: +15% damage\nPistol Sword: +15% ranged damage\nChain Blade: +2% combo bonus
modifiers.rapid_heatraygun.text=Faster is usually better. Each level the ray cycles quicker, the chain whips quicker and a thrown blade leaves your hand sooner.
modifiers.rapid_heatraygun.effects=Heat Ray Gun: +15% rate\nChain Blade: up to +60% rate\nThrown weapons: 20% shorter charge
